  meta: {de: 'TFT Set 19 heißt Prismatic Tour: Was der erste Teaser zeigt, welche Champions wir erkennen – und wen du in den Silhouetten siehst.',
    en: 'TFT Set 19 is called Prismatic Tour: what the first teaser shows, which champions we spot – and who you see in the silhouettes.'},
